WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.170
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:16.680
Last time: variable boxes · set · change

3
00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:21.850
Unit 3 · Building With Blocks

4
00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:24.580
Chapter 4 · Making Choices in Code

5
00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:37.020
Can code make choices too?

6
00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:41.490
Yes! And you'll teach it how

7
00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:48.850
School morning. Dark clouds!

8
00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:54.580
"If raining, umbrella. Else, a cap."

9
00:00:54.580 --> 00:01:03.020
Remember Unit 2? If-then stories!

10
00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:11.720
Not raining. What do you do?

11
00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:20.450
Else = otherwise → wear a cap

12
00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:25.270
Same thinking, now with blocks!

13
00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:30.420
The question is called a CONDITION

14
00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:40.640
A question with a yes or no answer

15
00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:47.460
Yes = TRUE · No = FALSE

16
00:01:47.460 --> 00:02:00.270
If block: inside runs only when TRUE

17
00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:05.890
if touching coin then change score by 1

18
00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:15.430
Pointy slot = condition · inside = action

19
00:02:15.430 --> 00:02:25.630
Touching coin? TRUE → score goes up

20
00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:39.340
Missed it? FALSE → nothing happens

21
00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:46.670
if touching wall then bounce, else move 10

22
00:02:46.670 --> 00:03:00.560
Not touching → FALSE → move 10 steps

23
00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:08.810
Touching wall → TRUE → bounce!

24
00:03:08.810 --> 00:03:20.490
One question, two paths

25
00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:30.620
Game time: True or false?

26
00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:40.330
Touching wall? True or false?

27
00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:44.720
TRUE! Billu is touching the wall

28
00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:54.490
Touching wall? True or false?

29
00:03:54.490 --> 00:04:03.530
FALSE! So the else part runs

30
00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:10.550
Story: ball touches goal → crowd cheers

31
00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:24.340
if touching goal then play cheer sound

32
00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:37.680
Dog barks only when it touches the cat?

33
00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:47.610
if touching cat then say "Woof!"

34
00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:53.790
Tip: one condition at a time

35
00:04:53.790 --> 00:05:01.570
Too many questions at once = confusing!

36
00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:17.290
One question → one clear answer

37
00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:21.840
Your turn: practice check

38
00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:32.820
Billu misses the coin. What happens?

39
00:05:32.820 --> 00:05:44.990
FALSE, no else → score stays the same

40
00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:59.430
Score 4 · jumps over the star · score = ?

41
00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:06.400
Still 4! Never touched → FALSE

42
00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:11.630
TRUE → the inside blocks run

43
00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:16.380
FALSE → the else part runs

44
00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:20.180
One condition at a time

45
00:06:20.180 --> 00:06:24.740
No else + FALSE = nothing happens

46
00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:32.430
Chapter 4 done!

47
00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:39.230
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
